Business Case
Rather than building a solution for all 1,079 invoices, build the e-invoicing workflow only for the 134 EU invoices:
•	Poland: 71
•	Spain: 52
•	Romania: 8
•	France: 2
•	Italy: 1
This significantly reduces cost and complexity.
Executive Recommendation
Given the transaction profile, I would recommend a PeopleSoft-connected Excel/Python E-Invoicing Utility that:
1.	Monitors the AP mailbox.
2.	Registers and validates all PO invoices.
3.	Identifies e-invoicing countries automatically.
4.	Generates PEPPOL/UBL-compliant XML only for the 134 impacted invoices.
5.	Uploads the XML to a PEPPOL provider (Storecove/Pagero).
6.	Creates PeopleSoft voucher-load files after successful submission.
This is likely the most cost-effective solution before considering enterprise tools such as Sovos or Avalara.
