What is a Voucher Load File?
A voucher-load file is simply a structured file that PeopleSoft can automatically import to create an AP voucher.
Instead of an AP analyst manually keying:
•	Vendor ID
•	Invoice Number
•	PO Number
•	Amount
•	Tax
•	Currency
the macro creates a file containing those fields.
Example:
CSV
BUSINESS_UNIT,VENDOR_ID,INVOICE_NO,PO_NO,AMOUNT,VAT_AMT,CURRENCY
EMEA01,100234,INV56789,PO12345,1500,300,EUR
Show more lines
PeopleSoft then reads the file and automatically creates the voucher.
